{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Contain non-fatal failures from the optional trace-header accessor.** This excludes `AssertionError` and most `LinkageError`s, so an accessor failure can abort user execution whenever any plugin is registered, despite tracing being optional. Catch all throwables from lookup/invocation, rethrow only `VirtualMachineError`/`ThreadDeath`, preserve `null` for absent APIs, and return `\"\"` for failed overrides. Add an error-throwing `Context` test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc752B-x","finding_digest":"be8fdff94c34192113b61563fdab2acde923ff5369d2672b357b645a140c6cab","finding_id":"arf_v1_x2h576kmgqmsce5wcvr73kzkzx","finding_key":"sdk/execution/runtimetraceheader::capture::optional-accessor-failure-isolation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/runtimetraceheader::capture::optional-accessor-failure-isolation","line":31,"observation_digest":"c998c59592e59e9963a1826e2fcaf17a4641db497ba96b95b11624b50e2aea24","observation_id":"aro_v1_zgmmlfms4wpjsy5bqjxc7sxrpj","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/RuntimeTraceHeader.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-06T05:01:10Z","review_id":"arr_v1_tprwconlucqr6zinis3z7ectdr","reviewed_base_sha":"ac6a6f5ea50d6a9098b716905f01c609e4c201ae","reviewed_head_sha":"88f55580001cbe2adc74245fc412b6b7f49068ac","reviewer":"codex","start_line":31,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_662ynqccut3l3muacrq5tpuz23","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-06T05:01:10Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
